## 🔄 Three-Ring Governance

**Respect boundaries:**

- **Inner Ring (Canon)** - READ ONLY (`jarvis/maat-graphs/`)
- **Middle Ring (Scholarship)** - Propose, don't mutate (`jarvis/rbg-library/`)
- **Outer Ring (Monetized)** - Full access (`jarvis/monetization/`)

**When in doubt: Default to stricter (read-only) behavior.**

