## ✅ Workflow (MANDATORY - Sankofa-Aligned)

**This workflow works from ANY project subdirectory:**

1. **Query gitMaat FIRST** - `memory.get_tasks(status="pending")` (MANDATORY LAW - Maat Memory database)
2. **SANKOFA: Learn from past** - Check gitMaat for similar work, decisions, learnings, changes
3. **Auto-detect workspace** - Find workspace root (look for `memory-bank/` or `.cursorrules`)
4. **Auto-detect project** - Identify which project you're in (check for `AGENTS.md`)
5. **Read Memory Bank (if needed)** - `{workspace_root}/memory-bank/projectbrief.md` for context only (NOT for tasks)
6. **Read project docs** - Project-specific `AGENTS.md` or docs
7. **Discover project** - `discover_project()` to see what exists (if MaatLangChain)
8. **Make changes** - Log everything to gitMaat (changes, decisions, learnings)
9. **Test** - Verify before committing
10. **Learn** - Log what worked/failed to gitMaat for future reference (Sankofa)
11. **Document** - Update Memory Bank and project docs if needed

